# Specs are working documents, not configuration. This is a configuration-only
# repo, so specs stay local and are never checked in. One file per branch under
# SPEC/, because concurrent sessions sharing a single SPEC.md overwrite each
# other. SPEC.md is the older flat layout, still ignored so existing ones stay.
